          "role": "assistant",
          "text": "先回忆一下：C 语言里 `for` 循环的括号中通常由三个部分组成，你能说出这三个部分分别是什么吗？",
          "phase": "recall",
          "taskId": "task:5c24e961161d5bf4bb7775575ecdee93",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-11T11:42:53.111548+00:00",
          "episodeId": "episode:ef5c61ac9bc05080adda2adc1e272c47",
          "messageId": "message:2f40500fc0b559a7a42ddfc7d53d01f5",
          "recordOrigin": "recorded",
          "relatedTaskIds": [
            "task:5c24e961161d5bf4bb7775575ecdee93"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "student",
          "text": "初始化，其他不知道",
          "phase": "recall",
          "taskId": "task:5c24e961161d5bf4bb7775575ecdee93",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-11T11:42:57.467059+00:00",
          "episodeId": "episode:ef5c61ac9bc05080adda2adc1e272c47",
          "messageId": "message:c6f6d515f25a54d3a0e41c103caad1dc",
          "recordOrigin": "recorded"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "text": "你记得“初始化”是对的。`for` 循环括号里的三个部分依次是：\n\n1. **初始化**：循环开始前执行一次，比如 `int i = 0`；\n2. **条件判断**：每轮循环前检查，成立才继续执行循环体，比如 `i < 10`；\n3. **更新**：每轮循环体执行完后进行，比如 `i++`。\n\n合起来就是：\n\n```c\nfor (初始化; 条件判断; 更新) {\n    // 循环体\n}\n```\n\n例如：\n\n```c\nfor (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", i);\n}\n```\n\n这里 `int i = 0` 是初始化，`i < 10` 是条件判断，`i++` 是更新。",
          "phase": "recall",
          "taskId": "task:5c24e961161d5bf4bb7775575ecdee93",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-11T11:42:57.467059+00:00",
          "episodeId": "episode:ef5c61ac9bc05080adda2adc1e272c47",
          "messageId": "message:304e22459f1958658adc598680cf1541",
          "recordOrigin": "recorded",
          "relatedTaskIds": [
            "task:5c24e961161d5bf4bb7775575ecdee93"
          ]
        },
        {
          "role": "student",
          "text": "还不知道",
          "phase": "recall",
          "taskId": "task:5c24e961161d5bf4bb7775575ecdee93",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-11T11:43:02.634353+00:00",
          "episodeId": "episode:ef5c61ac9bc05080adda2adc1e272c47",
          "messageId": "message:f92c25f8ce2e54799f84efb47dfbdaab",
          "recordOrigin": "recorded"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "text": "你卡住的是中间那一段。`for` 循环括号里的三个部分，用分号隔开，依次是：\n\n```c\nfor (初始化; 条件判断; 更新) {\n    // 循环体\n}\n```\n\n中间那部分就是**条件判断**，比如 `i < 10`。它每轮循环前都会检查一次：成立就继续执行循环体，不成立就结束循环。所以它决定了循环要不要继续。\n\n末尾那部分是**更新**，比如 `i++`，每轮循环体执行完后进行，用来改变循环变量。\n\n合起来看：`int i = 0` 是初始化，`i < 10` 是条件判断，`i++` 是更新。",
          "phase": "recall",
          "taskId": "task:5c24e961161d5bf4bb7775575ecdee93",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-11T11:43:02.634353+00:00",
